# Telegram Mini App / video editor — built by its own Dockerfile with
# apps/vibee-editor as the build context. Docker anchors patterns without `**`
# at the context root, so the `packages/`, `dist/` and `*.mp4` rules above do
# NOT match apps/vibee-editor/**. Without this line the bot image's build
# context silently gains ~92MB of editor media.
apps/
